Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 788 "[Crack of All Means] How to deal with the new disease"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Collect 1 of 900326000

Requires player level >= 54 and quest 787 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 1 of 900327000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "We have to go back to Herga. I'm tired, Master!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We have to go back to Nez. I'm tired, Master!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How's the result."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It seems the result is good. Is this [Shiny Fruit Juice]? This is the antibiotic for the disease? But this isn't enough.\n\nDeliver [Shiny Fruit Juice] to [Advisor] Herga following the request by [Secret Deputy] Clarence."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How's the result."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It seems the result is good. Is this [Shiny Fruit Juice]? This is the antibiotic for the disease? But this isn't enough.\n\nDeliver [Shiny Fruit Juice] to [Advisor] Nez following the request by [Secret Deputy] Clarence."

On in_progress
    Say "But where is the juice?"

On claimable
    Show quest "It's literally shining. Wait here.\n\nBring this [Shiny Fruit Juice Sample] to Ramark. He's one of the [Magic Associate] who's been dispatched to study this disease."
